1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:28,000
After his trials, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
The royal capital was thrown into chaos by marauding elves who had possessed the bodies of magic knights.

5
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Leopold and the Crimson Lion Kings found themselves battling a formidable elven foe who had taken control of their vice-captain, Randall.

6
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Just then.

7
00:00:46,000 --> 00:01:00,000
From now on, I won't allow anyone to stand in my way.

8
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:07,000
Though I may have lost my arm, though flames may scorch my body, as long as there are people waiting for me.

9
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:13,000
The captain of the Crimson Lion Kings, Vuegolion Vermillion, will press on!

10
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:14,000
You fought well, Leo. I'm proud.

11
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:15,000
I can't believe you're here!

12
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:20,000
As head of the Crimson Lion Kings, and as your older brother, I will be bested no longer!

13
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:26,000
At long last, Vuegolion had awoken from his slumber, with the mighty Fire Spirit Salamander at his side.

14
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Meanwhile, at the eye of the Midnight Sun's hideout...

15
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:44,600
Ah!

16
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Run along home now, children!

17
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:54,000
But captain!

18
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:57,000
Children, but Captain!

19
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Marilyona Vermillion prepared to fight Raya and his underlings on her own.

20
00:02:24,000 --> 00:02:46,000
Marilyona Vermillion prepared to fight Raya and his underlings on her own.

21
