だから待って、待って待って 同じ場所にいたいよ

25
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:11,000
Oh

26
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:44,300
So you want to stay here and slow us down so they can run back with their tails between their legs

27
00:03:44,300 --> 00:03:47,240
You seem like a benevolent leader madam royal

28
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:56,000
You don't understand a thing do you I?

29
00:03:57,040 --> 00:04:03,120
Sent those novices home because they were getting in my way slow you down. Don't make me laugh

30
00:04:03,120 --> 00:04:07,000
I wanted the chance to obliterate all of you personally

31
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:13,720
You want to obliterate us, huh?

32
00:04:14,500 --> 00:04:16,500
That's the best joke I've ever heard

33
00:04:17,140 --> 00:04:21,020
You should be able to understand the massive gap in our fighting potential

34
00:04:22,300 --> 00:04:26,160
Sorry miss high and mighty the anti-magic kids ours whether you like it or not

35
00:04:26,720 --> 00:04:31,640
Those swords and grimoire of his every bit of it is property of the real licked

36
00:04:31,640 --> 00:04:36,140
I've been hearing an awful lot of big talk from you time for action

37
00:04:36,140 --> 00:04:48,580
If it's the rookie you want you'll have to go through me

38
00:04:51,120 --> 00:04:55,080
Five against one good enough odds for you

39
00:04:55,080 --> 00:05:05,720
The captain's tough, but not even she can hold her own against all those enemies at once

40
00:05:06,220 --> 00:05:08,220
Come on. We have to go help her

41
00:05:08,380 --> 00:05:14,640
No way stupid we're leaving what you can't just abandon her like that at this rate

42
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:16,640
She won't make it out alive

43
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:22,360
And if we go waltzing back in there without a solid plan then none of us are getting out alive

44
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:28,420
You don't even have magic so you've got no idea how powerful these body snatchers are

45
00:05:28,780 --> 00:05:32,460
Do you seriously think I wanted to let a royal save my neck?

46
00:05:32,460 --> 00:05:38,060
The point is running away is our best shot at somebody surviving this

47
00:05:38,860 --> 00:05:40,700
She was strong to make that choice

48
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:44,400
So don't let it all be for nothing runt

49
00:05:51,460 --> 00:05:53,460
I'll cast wing magic

50
00:05:53,460 --> 00:05:55,460
Angel wing magic

51
00:05:56,800 --> 00:06:04,460
You expect to emerge victorious in a fight against us my you humans have gotten awfully impertinent while we've been asleep, haven't you?

52
00:06:04,460 --> 00:06:07,760
I believe I said less talk more action

53
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:11,360
All right, if that's what you want, then I say we should make this quick and easy

54
00:06:11,740 --> 00:06:14,640
Yes, unlike you greedy self-serving humans

55
00:06:14,640 --> 00:06:18,680
We elves are connected to others of our kind by a common bond that can never be broken

56
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:23,460
So try as you might your pitiful attacks won't put a scratch on any of us

57
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:26,360
Wing magic

58
00:06:26,360 --> 00:06:28,360
Angel flapping

59
